OL,3,GNEWSAParent concern over lack of funds
OL,4,Afor school trips
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead teacher Tracey Taylor said funding
OL,7,Fissues facing "all schools" means they
OL,8,Fhave had to ask parents for voluntary
OL,9,Fdonations. The government said it was
OL,10,Fputting "record investment" into
OL,11,Fschools.
